<p class="md-p">回文只需要比较两侧下一个有效字符。先分别跳过非字母数字字符，再统一大小写比较；不相同立即返回，相同才向内收缩。跳过时仍检查左右关系，避免越过尚未处理的区间。此代码逐个 char 处理字符。</p>
<p class="md-p">解法：</p>
<div class="md-list-wrap"><ul class="md-list md-depth-0"><li>左右指针向中间，跳过非字母数字字符。</li><li>统一转小写比较。</li></ul></div>
<p class="md-p">输入格式：一行字符串。 输出格式：true 或 false。</p>
<section class="code-card md-code-card"><div class="code-toolbar"><div class="toolbar-left"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="file-label">双指针总结.java</span></div><button class="copy-button md-copy" type="button">复制代码</button></div><div class="code-scroll"><pre class="md-pre" data-lang="java">import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static boolean solve(String s) {
        int left = 0, right = s.length() - 1;
        while (left &lt; right) {
            while (left &lt; right &amp;&amp; !Character.isLetterOrDigit(s.charAt(left))) left++;
            while (left &lt; right &amp;&amp; !Character.isLetterOrDigit(s.charAt(right))) right--;
            if (Character.toLowerCase(s.charAt(left)) != Character.toLowerCase(s.charAt(right))) {
                return false;
            }
            left++;
            right--;
        }
        return true;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        String s = sc.nextLine().trim();
        System.out.println(solve(s));
    }
}</pre></div></section>